WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.180
Admission process. check.

2
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.850
Uniform. check.

3
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.480
School regulations. check.

4
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.690
Cockpit regulations. check.

5
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.520
Don't worry. Aerial.

6
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.940
I did an application for you. too.

7
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.530
Arriving at Front Sector 73.

8
00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:35.610
Asticassia School of Technology. in five minutes.

9
00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.830
The ship will now enter a docking course.

10
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.720
That's the school?

11
00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:06.270
Mom. I finally made it!

12
00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:15.200
What? No way! You can't!

13
00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.530
This is the bridge.

14
00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.410
-They'll die!
-What?

15
00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:22.910
S-Someone is...

16
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.790
-Someone is outside!
-Rescue team. alert.

17
00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.620
A person is in need of rescue.

18
00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.500
-Prepare for extravehicular activity.
-Roger!

19
00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:31.920
-Please confirm victim's status.
-It should be over here.

20
00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.960
Are there any signs

21
00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.090
of collision with debris?

22
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.180
If you move forward. you gain two.

23
00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.260
What?

24
00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.010
I'll save them!

25
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.560
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

26
00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.230
Leave the rescue to us!

27
00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.110
Do they intend to leave the ship?

28
00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.190
Damn it...

29
00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.190
Attention mobile suit pilot!

30
00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.400
We're opening the exit hatch.

31
00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.780
Stay put until then!

32
00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.330
I-I'm sorry.

33
00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:03.790
If you spot someone
in need of rescue. let us know.

34
00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.910
We'll respond immediately.

35
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:06.910
Yes sir!

36
00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.160
Almost out of oxygen. Beginning rescue!

37
00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.380
Are...

38
00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.420
Are you okay?

39
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:00.970
Hello? Can you--

40
00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.010
Don't interfere!

41
00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.100
Excuse me?

42
00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.520
I'd almost made my escape!

43
00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.730
Because of you. it's all for nothing!

44
00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.110
You'll take responsibility for this.

45
00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.900
Sure.

46
00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.250
Ms. Suletta Mercury?

47
00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.790
Y-Yes!

48
00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.250
You're here to observe the drills. right?

49
00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:01.340
I'm Nika Nanaura.
a second-year student in Mechanics.

50
00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.630
If you have any questions. just ask.

51
00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.720
Yes. M...

52
00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:07.850
Thank y...

53
00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.680
-Thank y-you verr...
-Are you nervous?

54
00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.600
I-I've never...

55
00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.520
been to...

56
00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.520
a school before.

57
00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.440
It's your first time?

58
00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.940
Say. is it true you're from Mercury?

59
00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.650
Do people live there?

60
00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:25.450
What's your major?

61
00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.070
I'm in the Piloting department...

62
00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.990
-That makes you one of the elite!
-What did you transfer here for?

63
00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:33.830
My mother...

64
00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.870
told me to go.

65
00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.130
Your mother?

66
00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:42.250
So did she also tell you
to wear that old-fashioned hair band?

67
00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:44.630
Cut it out!

68
00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.430
Yes. of course!

69
00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.220
Seriously?

70
00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:00.980
Miorine Rembran.

71
00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.690
I've heard what happened.

72
00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:05.280
Prepare immediately to join the class.

73
00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.280
Yes sir.

74
00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.490
I-I'll take...

75
00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.950
I'll take responsibility!

76
00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.500
I-I'll help you with your escape!

77
00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.580
-Just tell me what I should do!
-It's you!

78
00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.460
You're the girl who got in my way!

79
00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:21.920
-Responsibility?
-What's that?

80
00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.000
Idiot!

81
00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:24.420
-This isn't the place...
-Responsibility. huh?

82
00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.720
Why not let her take it?

83
00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.680
You want to run away. right?

84
00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.220
-To Earth.
-Class is in session!

85
00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:32.350
No more chatter!

86
00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.140
Earth?

87
00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.840
A red Dilanza.

88
00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.630
It must be Guel Jeturk.

89
00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:08.970
Apologies for interrupting your drills.

90
00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.890
This is an official duel.

91
00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.680
approved by the Dueling Committee.

92
00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.850
I. Shaddiq Zenelli. will be the witness.

93
00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.600
I ask that no one interfere.

94
00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:22.900
A duel?

95
00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.200
Hey! That way is...

96
00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.290
-No way.
-Are they coming toward us?

97
00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:39.830
Go. Guel!

98
00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.250
Get him!

99
00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:45.790
Ms. Suletta!

100
00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.130
You fool! Do you want to get hit?

101
00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.760
Run!

102
00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.610
Did you see that. Miorine?

103
00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:11.280
How Guel Jeturk fights his duels!

104
00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.070
Both you and the company

105
00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:16.450
will be mine before long.

106
00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.040
Class is still in session. brother.

107
00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:21.040
Leave here immediately.

108
00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.000
The bastard down there laughed at me.

109
00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.000
Calling me a man with a runaway bride.

110
00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.340
Bride?

111
00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:29.800
That jerk.

112
00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.880
Hold it. Miorine!

113
00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:37.140
The rules say that when you lose.
you apologize like a groveling worm.

114
00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:39.890
I want you to see how he does that.

115
00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.500
I'm home.

116
00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.510
E-Excuse me!

117
00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.970
You again?

118
00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.800
I-I just wanted to thank you

119
00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.970
for saving me earlier.

120
00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:28.560
M-Ms. Miorine.

121
00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:31.850
-About your fiance--
-Stop. I never agreed to any of that.

122
00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:34.310
You mean that guy

123
00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:37.780
just decided on his own that you're engaged?

124
00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.400
-It was a duel.
-What?

125
00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.030
At our school.

126
00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.740
the students settle
important matters through duels.

127
00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.950
Money. authority. apologies...

128
00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.910
Even marriage partners.

129
00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:54.840
So you're going to marry him?

130
00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:55.960
Why?

131
00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.920
My lousy father designed it that way.

132
00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.550
Jeturk Heavy Machinery.

133
00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.930
Peil Technologies.

134
00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:09.600
Grassley Defense Systems...

135
00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:15.060
These three are the Benerit Group's
highest earners for this period.

136
00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.360
However.

137
00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:21.360
the Parneo Company has recorded a loss

138
00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.360
for three consecutive periods.

139
00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:27.950
Our group has no need
for companies in the red.

140
00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:32.000
I am hereby suspending their access
to the group's finances.

141
00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.880
Wait a minute. President Delling!

142
00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:38.130
-If that happens. we'll go bank--
-Exactly.

143
00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.010
You'll go bankrupt.

144
00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:45.470
Their financial documents indicate
there is potential for recovery.

145
00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.140
They've had their chance.

146
00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:51.180
The only thing I'm interested in is results.

147
00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.610
I've assigned two agents
to keep watch on Mistress Miorine.

148
00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.400
Would you like to meet them?

149
00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.820
For what?

150
00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.240
You know better than to waste my time.

151
00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.460
Stay out!

152
00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.420
I-I'm sorry!

153
00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.880
What is your deal?

154
00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.970
Excuse me. what is that?

155
00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:27.220
What is what?

156
00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.100
It's a tomato. naturally.

157
00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.140
That's a tomato?

158
00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.270
What exactly do you Mercurians eat?

159
00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.230
We do have tomato flavoring. but...

160
00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.490
Here.

161
00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:51.370
Th-Thank you!

162
00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.080
Just bite into it.

163
00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:02.880
It's good!

164
00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:05.550
Not all tomatoes taste good.

165
00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.180
That one's special.

166
00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:10.680
My mother made it.

167
00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.100
-She made a tomato?
-That specific breed. of course!

168
00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:16.730
Your mother...

169
00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:21.060
It's the same for me.

170
00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.230
My mother

171
00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:27.200
sent me here to study. so that I could

172
00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.110
make Mercury a more prosperous planet.

173
00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.070
That's why...

174
00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.410
I see.

175
00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.950
So your mother is still alive.

176
00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.040
S-S-Sorry!

177
00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.960
Hand me your student notebook.

178
00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:40.960
Why?

179
00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.800
You don't know the way back. right?

180
00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:49.890
Once I've given you the school map app.
scram and leave me alone.

181
00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.550
Playing farmer again?

182
00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.680
All this pretending you're on Earth...

183
00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.680
what's it good for?

184
00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:58.020
Guel.

185
00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.900
You can't just barge in here.

186
00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:01.770
I came up with a bright idea.

187
00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:05.730
From now on. you're gonna live
with us at Jeturk House.

188
00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.070
We can't have any more
escape attempts. after all.

189
00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:11.780
I never agreed to this.

190
00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.450
It's your father who made the rules.

191
00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.250
Do we always have to follow
what our parents decide?

192
00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.750
Aren't you daddy's little lap dog.

193
00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:25.170
What are you doing? Leave them alone!

194
00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.430
Oh. how clumsy. my lady!

195
00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.390
Better watch yourself!

196
00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.060
W-We have to... we have to stop--

197
00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:39.390
If you want to stop my brother. do it yourself.

198
00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.310
Sh-She needs h...

199
00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:46.570
I've been too lenient with you. it seems.

200
00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.530
As your future husband.

201
00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.820
I'll have to teach you some discipline.

202
00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:55.450
You just need to shut your mouth
and give yourself over to me.

203
00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:05.170
D-D-Didn't your mother ever teach you?

204
00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.090
You can't act like that!

205
00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:09.720
What the hell's your problem?

206
00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:13.800
Don't you know who I am?

207
00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:15.930
Um. well...

208
00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:17.890
A pushy suitor?

209
00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.100
I happen to be

210
00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:23.190
the heir to one of
the three branches of the Benerit Group.

211
00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.150
the head of the Dueling Committee.

212
00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.400
and the reigning Holder!

213
00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.190
Holder?

214
00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:33.160
The school's number one pilot.
as chosen through duels.

215
00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.030
Th-That may be true. but...

216
00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.660
But what's wrong is wrong!

217
00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:40.750
Please tell Ms. Miorine

218
00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.420
that you're sorry!

219
00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.880
Here at this school.

220
00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:49.250
right and wrong are decided through duels.

221
00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.300
Or would you like to duel me yourself?

222
00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:54.510
I accept.

223
00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.510
What?

224
00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:00.180
You and I will duel!

225
00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:03.850
Stop it! This has nothing to do with you!

226
00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.020
Sounds fun.

227
00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:07.400
If you lose. you'll have to leave the school.

228
00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.610
-Right.
-You idiot!

229
00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:11.860
I'll do it.

230
00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.610
Send the carrier to Gate No. 2!

231
00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.530
Load it with spare packs. too!

232
00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.870
The carrier is now moving to Gate No.2.

233
00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.370
Spare packages are loaded.

234
00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.670
There's gonna be a duel!

235
00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.210
With Mr. Guel!

236
00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.290
-Who's he against?
-A transfer student. I hear.

237
00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.130
Passage to tactical testing sector.

238
00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.420
No obstacles.

239
00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.920
Takeoff granted!

240
00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:39.470
Are you sure about this?

241
00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.850
If Delling dies.

242
00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:45.140
my son Guel's engagement will be secured.

243
00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:48.610
I have to act before the results
of these silly "duels" are nullified.

244
00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.190
Set the detonation
for ten minutes after launch.

245
00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:55.570
Delling...

246
00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.870
our long friendship ends today.

247
00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.580
Environmental setting data
for tactical testing sector received.

248
00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.170
Coriolis correction. stable.

249
00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.420
Bioinfo. identification complete.

250
00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.430
Permet link. satisfactory.

251
00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:20.010
KP001. Guel Jeturk.

252
00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.430
Dilanza. let's go!

253
00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:32.570
Show-off.

254
00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.320
Aren't you going to watch. Elan?

255
00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.070
Who cares.

256
00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.700
Why accept a duel
from that country bumpkin?

257
00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.740
I'll make it quick for her.

258
00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:46.330
I'm the future ace of Dominicus. after all.

259
00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.210
There she is. The Mercurian girl.

260
00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.800
-Tricolor means a three-colored flag.
-She's got a flashy one. too.

261
00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:58.380
-especially the national emblem of old France.
-I don't see a logo. Could it be handmade?

262
00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:02.470
-Arriving at the designated coordinates.
-With mutual consent by both parties.

263
00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:04.310
we will now begin the duel.

264
00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:06.560
As always. victory will go

265
00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:10.480
to the first one to break the blade antenna
of their opponent's mobile suit.

266
00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:13.150
Both parties. face off!

267
00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.740
-What?
-Isn't that the princess?

268
00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:18.450
I thought it was the transfer student?

269
00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:21.740
How did Ms. Miorine board Aerial?

270
00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:24.490
Right.

271
00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.870
Ms. Suletta?

272
00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.620
What's wrong?

273
00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.750
What's the meaning of this. Miorine?

274
00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.750
I'm sick of people making decisions for me.

275
00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:38.550
This is my fight!

276
00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:43.470
Impudent girl. Have it your way.

277
00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:46.770
I'll show you firsthand
that you're no match for me.

278
00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.180
Guel?

279
00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.730
Do you approve the change in duel opponent?

280
00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.810
I approve.

281
00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:57.030
Victory is never decided by
mobile suit performance alone.

282
00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:01.070
Nor by the skill of the pilot. alone.

283
00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.530
-The result itself is the only truth!
-The result itself is the only truth!

284
00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.290
Fix release!

285
00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.660
Weapons. Where are the weapons?

286
00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.430
Did you think any amateur
could handle a mobile suit?

287
00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:26.010
Two minutes left.

288
00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.890
It's my life...

289
00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.980
let me do as I please!

290
00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.770
I'll decide for myself!

291
00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:44.740
The princess of Management Strategy
has no chance of winning.

292
00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:47.280
Take a good look at yourself.

293
00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:52.120
You're nothing more than a trophy.

294
00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:54.960
An alert?

295
00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:56.210
What? An intruder?

296
00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.550
Who the hell are you?

297
00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.760
Exceeding speed limit.　　
Please decrease speed.

298
00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.010
Why is it showing your name. Nika?

299
00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.600
I guess I helped.

300
00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:15.310
Why is--

301
00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:17.560
What are you doing?

302
00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.230
-Give it back!
-What?

303
00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:22.030
Aerial is mine!

304
00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.910
I told you. this has nothing to do with you!

305
00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.160
Then fight in your own mobile suit!

306
00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.790
-Don't be so stingy!
-What's going on?

307
00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:30.910
-It's just another mobile suit!
-A falling-out?

308
00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.040
Aerial isn't just another one!

309
00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.040
We were raised together.

310
00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.630
as family!

311
00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:40.750
Family?

312
00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:43.130
Why don't you let me fulfill
my responsibility by winning?

313
00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.510
Aerial and I will never

314
00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:47.550
lose to the likes of him!

315
00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:49.760
"The likes of him"?

316
00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:53.680
Shaddiq. I'm changing opponents again!

317
00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:56.310
Give him the go ahead. Cecilia.

318
00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:57.400
Sure thing.

319
00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:02.070
Brother!

320
00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:05.030
I'll correct your ignorance.
you country bumpkin!

321
00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:09.320
Straight ahead!

322
00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:11.330
My mother taught me.

323
00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:13.080
"If you run. you gain one."

324
00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:16.170
"but if you move forward. you gain two."

325
00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:17.420
What?

326
00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:20.170
When you run. you gain one by not losing.

327
00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:22.710
But if you move forward...

328
00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:23.880
You can win?

329
00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:25.090
Whether you win or not.

330
00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:26.800
there are two things you gain.

331
00:22:28.220 --> 00:22:31.050
Experience and pride.

332
00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:33.060
Not to mention trust!

333
00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:49.950
A shield?

334
00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:51.070
She blocked it.

335
00:22:52.030 --> 00:22:53.330
In that case...

336
00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:09.220
What just happened?

337
00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:11.890
What kind of mobile suit is that?

338
00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:13.600
GUND-ARM...

339
00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:16.520
Gundam.

340
00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:24.440
Wh-What... What the hell are you?!

341
00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:32.120
It's time.

342
00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:33.870
Mr. Jeturk.

343
00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:36.790
-A last-minute intervention?
-No.

344
00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:39.540
Your son was defeated in a duel.

345
00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:42.170
What?

346
00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:44.670
Even if you killed President Delling now.

347
00:23:44.710 --> 00:23:47.800
Master Guel won't be Mistress Miorine's fiance.

348
00:23:48.300 --> 00:23:51.010
Who was the opponent? Grassley?

349
00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:52.640
-Peil?
-No.

350
00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:55.390
It was...

351
00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:04.480
Excuse me...

352
00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:07.940
I-I won.

353
00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:10.900
So it seems.

354
00:24:11.660 --> 00:24:13.320
Suletta Mercury...

355
00:24:16.240 --> 00:24:18.500
Huh? What the...

356
00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:19.790
How did you...

357
00:24:19.830 --> 00:24:22.290
This attire is the emblem of victory.

358
00:24:22.330 --> 00:24:23.790
The emblem of the Holder.

359
00:24:25.170 --> 00:24:28.590
It's also the emblem of my fiance.

360
00:24:30.090 --> 00:24:32.930
I told you. didn't I? Those are the rules.

361
00:24:32.970 --> 00:24:35.050
But I...

362
00:24:35.100 --> 00:24:37.350
I'm a woman.

363
00:24:37.430 --> 00:24:40.480
I guess Mercury is rather conservative.

364
00:24:40.560 --> 00:24:42.600
That sort of thing is commonplace here.

365
00:24:44.650 --> 00:24:47.570
Nice to meet you. my groom.

366
00:27:52.210 --> 00:27:56.130
Next time on
Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury.

367
00:27:56.170 --> 00:27:57.880
"The Cursed Mobile Suit."
